abstract: >-
  Validated R analysis code and reproducibility documentation supporting a
  cross-cohort transcriptomic study of pathological nodal involvement in
  esophageal squamous cell carcinoma. The repository is an audited
  reproducibility reconstruction based on preserved analysis objects, retained
  R history, recovered execution commands, and locked numerical audit targets.
